 "name": "Heat Extinguishment",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/disaster-flames.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Disaster Flames — Cursed Technique Reversal</em></p><p>By mastering Reverse Cursed Technique and your primary ability, you have inverted your control over flames into the power to extinguish and nullify them, even affecting the heat within living beings.</p>\n<p>As an action or reaction to being targeted by a cursed technique AOE that deals fire damage, you can spend 2 cursed energy to extinguish a 10 feet cube of flames within 30 feet where the technique is nullified. If the technique is an attack roll, you can spend 2 CE as a reaction to reduce the fire damage by 6d8. If an attack’s damage is reduced to 0, any additional effects of the attack are canceled out.</p>\n<p><strong>Hypothermic Touch.</strong> At 3rd level, as an action you can spend an amount of cursed energy up to twice your CE modifier to make a melee attack roll and extinguish the heat within a target's body. The target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or take 2d8 cold damage per cursed energy spent. On a success, they take half as much damage. If they fail by 5 or more, their movement is reduced to 0 until the end of their turn. This reversal does not affect creatures that do not rely on body heat or are immune to cold damage.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
